module shift_count128 .
rem RFC-0153 §8-8 (2026-10-24) — 128 비트 시프트 양은 범위 검사 전에 잘리지 않는다. ok_* 는 값을, bad_* 는 E-VM-SHIFT / panic 을 낸다.
fn shw input x u128 . input n u128 . output u128 . do return shl x. n. . . end .
fn shs input x u8 . input n u128 . output u8 . do return shl x. n. . . end .
fn shr8 input x u8 . input n i128 . output u8 . do return shr x. n. . . end .
fn wsh input x u128 . input n u128 . output u128 . do return wrap_shl x. n. . . end .
fn ok_wide output u128 . do return shw 1 127 . . end .
fn ok_small output u8 . do return shs 1 7 . . end .
fn ok_wrap output u128 . do return wsh 1 18446744073709551617 . . end .
fn bad_wide output u128 . do return shw 1 18446744073709551616 . . end .
fn bad_small output u8 . do return shs 1 18446744073709551616 . . end .
fn bad_neg output u8 . do return shr8 128 -1 . . end .
fn bad_big output u8 . do return shs 1 9223372036854775808 . . end .
